    "title": "Check Your Understanding",
    "long_instructions": "> ####Think of two real-world tasks that repeat.\r\n> 1. What is one task that would work best as a **for loop**. How does the loop know when to stop?\r\n> 2. What is one task that would work best as a **while loop**. How does the loop know when to stop>\r\n> 3. Choose one of those tasks and write a prompt you could give to an AI tool. What words in your prompt would help the AI choose the correct loop type?\r\n\r\n\r\n",
